              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نبات — nabāt — \"plant life; a plant\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "رأينا نباتا غريبا بجانب الشلال. raʾaynā nabātan gharīban bi-jānib ash-shallāl. We saw a strange plant beside the waterfall."
